  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2301.23 “Vessel registration certificate” means, for purposes of this chapter, a certificate of number in accordance with RSA 270-E:12, III.\n\nSource. #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35 (formerly Saf-C 2301.22)",
